5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Hello everyone. Since our current arrangement is breaking down, we need a logical way to restructure it. I believe we should start by looking at the actual usage data to identify where the friction is.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'm totally on board! Let's make sure we don't just make a plan that looks good on paper but is a total pain to actually do. I want this to be easy for everyone!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see such energy. In my experience, the most enduring agreements are those built on a foundation of truth and kindness. Let us look deeply into our habits to find a path of harmony.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm in. But we can't just look at numbers and assume that'll fix everything. If we don't figure out why we're all getting annoyed with each other, we're just moving the problem around. Let's get this right.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help fix this! I want us all to be happy and keep using the car together. Let's find some cool clues to make everything fair and fun!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Takumi that we need to understand the root of the friction. To get a clear picture of the actual burden and usage, I will look into the ""Hours of use recorded in the diary"" and ""Month's trial of recording every run.""","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"I want to know where all our time is actually going! I'll check the ""Hours of use recorded in the diary"" and ""The spell of checking each other's figures"" to see if the admin is a nightmare.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"To ensure we are truly fair to one another, I wish to understand the hidden costs of our shared journey. I will examine ""Last year's tax, insurance and parking papers"" and ""Last year's fuel receipts.""","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm going to check ""What two other car-sharing households said"" and ""The spell of checking each other's figures."" I want to know what actually makes these groups fall apart so we don't repeat the same mistakes.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I want to know the real numbers! I'll check ""Last year's fuel receipts"" and ""Month's trial of recording every run"" to see who's been driving and how much we're actually spending!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Since May and Kenji are also looking into some of the same data, we can compare our findings later. I'm interested to see if the recorded hours match the actual frequency of use.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, definitely! I'm curious if the ""official"" diary actually tells the whole story or if there's a bunch of hidden chaos we're all just ignoring. Let's see who's actually doing the heavy lifting!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to compare notes, for truth often reveals itself in the gaps between different perspectives. I hope our findings will allow us to support one another with a spirit of generosity and clarity.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, generosity is fine, but we need a system that actually works. If we just hope for the best without fixing the tension, we're just waiting for the next argument to happen. I'm sticking to my research.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, you're so serious! But I think if we find the real numbers, it'll be way easier to stop the arguments! I can't wait to see the clues we find. Let's do our best, everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's proceed with the research. I will focus on the usage patterns to see if the current system is actually sustainable for everyone. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready to dive in! I'll be the one keeping things lively while we hunt for the truth. Let's see if we can find a way to make this car-sharing thing actually effortless! See you all soon!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I shall now reflect upon the documents. May we all find the clarity we seek, and may our hearts remain open as we strive for a balance that honors everyone's contribution. I look forward to our reunion.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm going to find out what actually kills these arrangements. If we don't fix the way we're treating each other, no amount of data will save us. I'll see you all in the next round.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm going to go hunt for those numbers right now! I'll find out exactly how much fuel we've used and who's been driving the most. See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
